#AREA Temple of Demise~

#AUTHORS Presto~

#HELPS
-1 TEMPLEOFDEMISE~
Demise was once a powerful god like Order and Chaos.  Instead of being one of
the extreme forces, he had powers that came from both sides.  Chaos and Order
actually worked together to imprison Demise and strip him of his powers.  In
doing so he became the God of Death.  He exists now, chained in the Temple
created for him north of Ocean City where he waits for Chaos and Order to
destroy each other so he may walk free once more.

  (-) Back

{-}PRESTO
~
0 $~

#RANGES 30 99 30 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#MOBILES
#11800
guard~
a Guard~
A guard is here!~
This guard seems angry at your intrusion, and attacks!~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+7999 1d1+73
0 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)==0
  rescale 11800 $n 85
  mpkill $n
else
  rescale 11800 $n 150
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>give_prog I11812~
mpecho A chaos bomb *** INCINERATES *** the guard!
mpjunk i11812
mpgoto 11904
suicide 
~
>death_prog 100~
if level($n) < 25
  mpoload 11808
else
  if level($n) < 50
    mpoload 11809
  else
    if level($n) < 75
      mpoload 11810
    else
      mpoload 11811
    endif
  endif
endif
if rand(10)
  mpoload 11812
endif
~
|
