#11806
demise god lord death~
Demise~
Lord Demise, the God of Death is here!~
You see nothing special about it.  It resembles an old man suffering more 
pain than imaginable.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
99 0 0 1d1+21727 1d1+230
10000 838032
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpforce $n external GREET01.WAV
say Greetings, $n.
say What have you come here for?  To free, kill, or follow me?
~
>speech_prog free~
say The chains may only be broken by both Chaos and Order.
say They created the chains together and imprisoned me eons ago.
say Thank you for trying to help, but there is nothing you can do.
emote ponders a thought for a second.
say You know ... I could really use something to look at.
say Staring at these plain grey walls is quite boring.
mpat 11854 mppurge i11801
mpat 11854 mppurge i11813
mpquiet on
mpoload 11813
mpat 11854 drop i11813
mpquiet off
~
>speech_prog kill~
mpforce $n external LAUGH01.WAV
say MUHAHAHAHAHA!  What a futile effort that would be.
say I may be imprisoned, but I am still immortal.  
say There is nothing you can do to end my imprisonment.
say Though I welcome the idea.
~
>speech_prog follow~
if whichgod($n)==1
  say You follow Order!  Leave me now, traitor!
  mptransfer $n 11404
  mpat 11404 mpforce $n look
else
  if whichgod($n)==2
    say You follow Chaos!  Leave me now, traitor!
    mptransfer $n 11410
    mpat 11410 mpforce $n look
  else
    say You wish to follow me, eh?
    say Many wanderers have attempted to follow me just as you have.
    say But as you can see, I'm in no condition to grant it to you.
    say If you can eliminate Chaos or Order, the chains will be weak
    say enough for me to break free, and then I will regain all the
    say powers I once had.  Then you may follow me.
    if quest(25,4,$n) >5
    else
      mpoload 11803
      give band $n
      say This will help you.  It is all I can do right now.
      mpmadd $n quest 24 4 1
    endif
    mptransfer $n 11420
    mpat 11420 mpforce $n look
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog I11813~
say Thanks!  It's just what I need to decorate this cell!
mpoload 11802
give broach $n
mpjunk i11802
mpjunk i11813
mpat 11854 mpoload 11801
~
>give_prog I11812~
emote takes the Chaos bomb and shoves it up your ass!  *** OUCH ***
laugh $n
~
>death_prog 100~
say So, you think you have defeated me?  *** MUHAHAHAHAHA ***
emote morphs into a mouse, and scampers into a crack in the wall.
mpgoto 11904
~
>fight_prog 100~
cast "acid blast" $r
~
>hitprcnt_prog 20~
mpquiet on
cast heal self
cast heal self
cast heal self
cast heal self
cast heal self
mpquiet off
~
